1 0 0 1 54 516 Tm
(SECTION 1. ENGAGEMENT AND MASTER RECORDING COMMITMENT) Tj
/F1 9 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 503 Tm
(1.1 Engagement: Company hereby engages Artist to render exclusive recording services to produce,) Tj
/F1 9 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 489 Tm
(record, and deliver one \(1\) full-length studio project consisting of ten \(10\) commercially satisfactory) Tj
/F1 9 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 475 Tm
